{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は12枚目シングルの制作など\n忙しくさせてもらってます。\n毎日毎日が楽しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/4188176/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パシフィコ横浜にて握手会\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼＼\\└('ω')┘//／／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのツインテールかなり\n恥ずかしかった...\n次関東の握手会は9月って事を\nファンの皆様に言われて知りました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"9月までの辛抱だー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/4188176/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに3部はツインテールで\n4部はハーフツインという\nツインテール祭り(((^-^)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はは(((^-^)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は名古屋！宜しくお願いします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........................................."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして皆さんにお知らせしたい事が\nあります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHK『Ｒの法則』R's6期生に\nなりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rの法則のメンバーに選んで頂き\n感謝しています。\n私はしっかり者と思われていますが、\n知ってる人もいるとは思うのですが\nかなりの内弁慶でして、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"う〜ん\nまだまだ未熟者ですが\n応援宜しくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/4188176/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はこれ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/4188176/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛い可愛い野良猫ちゃん♡\nお待ちしてマース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『前回の写真で一言』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いなぁって思った方を\n紹介していきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.34 みっつーみっつーみっつー さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑顔だけど実は全力で手を\n握りつぶしあってるの図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.51 まさかん さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Before→After"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.90 偽ハタ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイトチョコできのこの山作ってみました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.107 nocchi(グレー@川後P命名) さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀「ねえねえみりあ、そろそろ手に爪\nくい込ませてくるのはやめてくれない？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあ「そういいながら未央奈も\n関節とろうとしてるよね？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.136 あの係木村 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人「フュージョン！！！！！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.168 みり愛のポスター護国寺 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達「ホワイトハイ」ではなく\n「ホワイト アンド ホワイト」です！\nそれでは聴いてください\n『保護色ブルース』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.189 yuto さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈、みり愛「せーの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「バルス♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.221 エルサルバドル君 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達、実写版「二人はプリキュア」です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.310 キリト さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湯葉の上にある二本のエリンギ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.379 ふみにぃ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お分かりいただけただろうか...\nこの真っ白の中に大食いシスターズが\n写っていることを..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.410 ぴ〜く〜 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大食いシスターズの展示はこちらです。\n二人で回転寿司荒らしを\nしていたところを捕獲しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.437 ナルミヤ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛:これ真夏さんだったら\nズームアウトしちゃうね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈:それなち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.557 たかゆき0425 さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みりあとみおなの間違え探しー、\n違う所は372個あるよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.594 こーすけ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のラッキーカラーがお互い\n白色だったので手を繋いで\n運気をあげている"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"No.742 見せかけ堕天使男⊿ さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白、と思うじゃん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな面白。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日〜5月編〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/4188176/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"〜6月編〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miria.watanabe/img/miria.watanabe/img/2015/06/08/418